  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PDC P Workshop om Milj&#xf6;teknik och innovationer</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PDC P Workshop on Env technology and innovations - PDC P CIT HUS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A PDC planning grant for cooperation between Chalmers Institute for Industrial Technology and Hanoi University of Science. The aim is to identify cooperation areas within environment from a sustainable developmen aspect and also from a business view. A workshop will be carried out in Hanoi to identify areas and a broader network of partners for future cooperation.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">En PDC planning grant mellan Chalmers Institute for Industrial Technology och Hanoi University of Science. Syftet &#xe4;r att identifiera ett antal samarbetsomr&#xe5;den intressanta ur en milj&#xf6;aspekt f&#xf6;r Vietnam och aff&#xe4;rsid&#xe9; f&#xf6;r Sverige. En workshop ska h&#xe5;llas i Vietnam d&#xe4;r man ska samla ett antal organisationer och f&#xf6;retag f&#xf6;r att diskutera framtida samarbete mer detaljerat.</narrative>
  </description>
